        <description>Use this tool to narrow down and select which customer financial account is being reported for fraud or suspicious activity.

When to call:
- Call this tool at the start of a fraud or scam inquiry when the customer mentions unauthorized activity on their account.

Inputs to provide:
- 'phone_number': Caller phone number to identify customer accounts.
- 'account_type_filter': If the customer mentions the type of account, pass 'credit_card', 'transaction' (checking or savings), or 'lending' (loan or line of credit). If unspecified, leave blank to retrieve all accounts.

Outputs &amp; Context:
- Read the 'voice_agent_message' to prompt the customer or confirm their account.
- Store the returned 'selected_account_sys_id' in context to use for retrieving transactions.</description>
